!! _POC-XRL3VPN(V) XR01(PE・XRd、V 版は XRv9000)= XRT-07 の M8-1〜5 を解き終えた設定+お客さま側の IF。
!! CEA1 向けの IF だけグローバルでアドレスを付けておく(VRF へ移した時にアドレスが残るかを PoC で見る)。VRF・PE-CE・VPNv4 は PoC の段で足す。
interface Loopback0
 ipv4 address 10.255.0.1 255.255.255.255
!
interface Loopback1
 description NMS - reserved for the management systems, not in IS-IS
 ipv4 address 10.255.255.1 255.255.255.255
!
interface Loopback100
 description CUSTOMER-A (advertised in BGP only)
 ipv4 address 10.30.0.1 255.255.0.0
!
interface {{ links[3] }}
 description PRIMARY to RT01
 ipv4 address 10.0.1.1 255.255.255.0
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[4] }}
 description BACKUP to RT03
 ipv4 address 10.0.3.1 255.255.255.0
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[5] }}
 description CUST-A site 1 (CEA1)
 ipv4 address 172.16.11.1 255.255.255.0
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[6] }}
 description CUST-B site 1 (CEB1)
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[7] }}
 description SHARED-SERVICES (SVC)
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[8] }}
 description INTERNET (INET AS 64500)
 no shutdown
!
ipv4 access-list LDP-SP
 10 permit ipv4 host 10.255.0.11 any
!
router isis CORE
 is-type level-2-only
 net 49.0001.0100.0000.0001.00
 log adjacency changes
 address-family ipv4 unicast
  metric-style wide
 !
 interface Loopback0
  passive
  address-family ipv4 unicast
  !
 !
 interface {{ links[3] }}
  point-to-point
  address-family ipv4 unicast
   metric 10
   mpls ldp sync
  !
 !
 interface {{ links[4] }}
  point-to-point
  address-family ipv4 unicast
   metric 100
   mpls ldp sync
  !
 !
!
router bgp 65000
 bgp router-id 10.255.0.1
 address-family ipv4 unicast
  network 10.30.0.0/16
 !
 neighbor 10.255.0.12
  remote-as 65000
  update-source Loopback0
  address-family ipv4 unicast
  !
 !
!
mpls oam
!
mpls ldp
 igp sync delay on-session-up 10
 session protection for LDP-SP duration 600
 neighbor 10.255.0.13:0 password clear CoreLdp-2026
 address-family ipv4
  label
   local
    allocate for host-routes
    advertise
     explicit-null
    !
   !
  !
 !
 interface {{ links[3] }}
 !
 interface {{ links[4] }}
 !
!
end
